      <title>Navigating Bison Hub Workshop</title>
      <description><![CDATA[<div>  <img src="https://localist-images.azureedge.net/photos/53992509285346/huge/e3aad1e4564c0f9064194a4a1e429bb21e4a508e.jpg" style="width: 100%;" />  <div style="font-size: 0.9em; color: #555;"><strong>Mon, 21 Sep 2026</strong></div>  <div><p>New to Howard and not sure where to find your financial aid information? Join us for a step-by-step workshop on navigating the BisonHub portal!</p>

<p> </p>

<p>We’ll show you how to access and view your financial aid awards, where to find important award information, and how to navigate the portal with confidence. This session is designed especially for new students who want to better understand their financial aid information and make the most of BisonHub.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>📅 Date: September 21
<br>🕐 Time: 1:00 p.m.</p>

<p> </p>

<p>This workshop takes place via Zoom meeting. Register here: <a href="https://shorturl.at/hjaJ6">https://shorturl.at/hjaJ6</a></p>

<p> </p>

<p>Bring your questions and get comfortable navigating BisonHub—we’re here to help you get started!</p>

